sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Person (break-glass)
    participant B as gcp-lz-bootstrap
    participant G as GCS · KMS
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant L as gcp-lz-* stacks
    P->>B: tofu apply with local state
    B->>G: lz project · bucket · key ring lz · github-pool · tf-apply-lz@
    P->>G: tofu init -migrate-state (encrypted with lz/tofu-state)
    P->>P: deletes the local state · drops their organisation roles
    Note over P: remains as break-glass with a sign-in alert
    CI->>L: PR with the landing-zone Environment · tf-apply-lz@
    L->>G: org policies · projects · APIs · identities · KMS · registry · DNS
    L->>L: qa onboarding: cidr · public_id · zone · keys · SAs · BinAuthz rule
    Note over CI,L: the bootstrap is never run again
